{"id":"07abe5a106","t":"What a Bountiful Harvest, Demon Lord!","c":"ml+io:/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/3198300011173643063-193x278.jpg","n":93,"l":93,"s":["ml","mg"],"k":{"ml":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord","mg":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord"},"u":1795078512971,"desc":"العمل من نفس كاتب واستوديو [The World’s Best Engineer] أصبحتُ الزعيم الأخير، ملك الشياطين في هذا العالم. لكن المشكلة أن أي قرار أتخذه يقودني إلى الهلاك! إن غزوتُ العالم البشري الآن، فسألقى حتفي على يد البطل الذي قمتُ بتدريبه حتى بلغ أقصى قوته. وإن تراجعتُ وأوقفتُ الغزو، فلن يتركني أتباعي، القادة الأربعة السماويون من الشياطين، وشأني، وسأنتهي ميتًا جوعًا بين أيديهم. إذن، ما الحل الوحيد المتبقي؟ لا معارك، لا غزو… بل الزراعة!","type":"مانهوا","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اثاره","اكشن","خيال","سحر","شونين","فنتازيا","مغامرة","نظام"],"src":{"ml":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord","mg":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|/manga/what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord/1/","mg":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|"},"2":{"ml":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|/manga/what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord/2/","mg":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|"},"3":{"ml":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|/manga/what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord/3/","mg":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|"},"4":{"ml":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|/manga/what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord/4/","mg":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|"},"5":{"ml":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|/manga/what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord/5/","mg":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|"},"6":{"ml":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|/manga/what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord/6/","mg":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|"},"7":{"ml":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|/manga/what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord/7/","mg":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|"},"8":{"ml":"what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord|/manga/what-a-bountiful-harvest-demon-lord/8/","mg":"wha